extends ../../layouts/master.pug

block title
    title Student Handbook | Policies & Guidelines | Nazarene Bible College
    meta(name='description', content='Access the Nazarene Bible College Student Handbook for 2024 – 2025. Review academic policies, student expectations, community guidelines, and resources for success in ministry training. ')

block header
    include ../../components/header.pug

block content
    section.section-box
        .banner-hero.banner-head-image(style='background: url(/assets/imgs/stock/AdobeStock_332409626.jpeg); background-position: center 80%;')
            .container.text-center
                h1.text-display-3.color-white.mb-20 Student Handbook 2024 - 2025

    section.section-box.mt-80.mb-100
        .container
            .row
                .col-lg-2
                .col-lg-8
                    p.text-body-lead.color-gray-900.mb-40.text-center
                        | The Student Handbook outlines Nazarene Bible College’s academic policies, student expectations, community standards, and resources designed to support your success. Students are encouraged to reference the handbook regularly as the official guide for conduct, communication, and academic accountability.
                    h2.text-heading-2.text-center.mb-40 What the Handbook Covers
                    p.text-body-text.color-gray-900.mb-40.text-center
                        | An overview of major policy areas including student conduct, academic integrity, housing (if applicable), and technology use.
            .row
                .col-lg-6
                    .box-gray-100.bdrd-16.p-40.text-center.mb-40
                        h2.text-heading-3.color-gray-900.mb-20 Student Handbook
                        p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mb-30
                            | Click above to open the file or right-click and select "Save Target As" to save the file.
                        a.btn.btn-black.icon-arrow-right-white(href='/assets/docs/student-handbook.pdf', target='_blank') Download the Student Handbook
                .col-lg-6
                    .box-gray-100.bdrd-16.p-40.text-center.mb-40
                        h3.text-heading-4.color-gray-900.mb-15 Download Adobe Reader
                        h4.text-heading-6.color-gray-900.mb-20 Trouble Opening?
                        p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mb-30
                            | Nazarene Bible College Downloadable Documents require Adobe Acrobat Reader.
                        a.btn.btn-default.icon-arrow-right(href='https://get.adobe.com/reader/', target='_blank', rel='noopener') Get Acrobat Reader for Free
            .row
                .col-lg-2
                .col-lg-8
                    h2.text-heading-2.text-center.mt-40.mb-40 Student Support & Resources
                    p.text-body-text.color-gray-900.mb-40.text-center
                        | List support services (advising, library, counselling) and link to forms & portal as applicable.
